      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "**（1）基本思想**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "三元组距离满足 $D=|a-b|+|b-c|+|c-a|=2(\\max(a,b,c)-\\min(a,b,c))$。三个指针分别从三个非空升序数组的开头出发，每轮更新最小距离，并只推进当前最小值所在数组的指针。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "保持当前最小值而增大另外的值，不能缩小最大值与最小值之差，因此这一步不会跳过最优结果。任一数组耗尽后结束。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "**（2）C语言实现**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "block": true,
          "lang": "c",
          "value": "#include <limits.h>\n\nlong long findMin(const int A[], int n, const int B[], int m,\n                  const int C[], int p) {\n    int i = 0, j = 0, k = 0;\n    long long best = LLONG_MAX;\n    while (i < n && j < m && k < p) {\n        int lo = A[i], hi = A[i];\n        if (B[j] < lo) lo = B[j];\n        if (C[k] < lo) lo = C[k];\n        if (B[j] > hi) hi = B[j];\n        if (C[k] > hi) hi = C[k];\n        long long distance = 2 * ((long long)hi - lo);\n        if (distance < best) best = distance;\n        if (best == 0) break;\n        if (A[i] == lo) ++i;\n        else if (B[j] == lo) ++j;\n        else ++k;\n    }\n    return best;\n}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "**（3）复杂度**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "每个指针只前进，时间复杂度 $O(n+m+p)$，辅助空间 $O(1)$。距离使用long long计算和返回。"
        }
      ]
    },
